            "text": "To log in to **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**, use the official Canada.ca page:\n\n**Go to:** Canada.ca \u2192 **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)** ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\nYou can sign in using one of these options:\n\n1. **Interac Sign-In Partner** \u2014 sign in with your online banking credentials  \n2. **GCKey** \u2014 Government of Canada username and password  \n3. **Provincial sign-in** \u2014 available for **BC and Alberta** ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\nFor safety, only use the official **Canada.ca** page and avoid unofficial \u201cService Canada login\u201d links from ads or third-party websites.",
